      rmax Cde Cpe hBunifMain hrate.1 hrate.2.le
      U V De mlow mhigh hU0 hV0 hDe0 hULp hVLp hUb hVb hDeLp hmLp hDeb hmb
    refine ⟨fun N om => (Cm * 2 ^ t1) * (U N om * (1 + V N om)) +
